# Internal service hostnames.
# api.home and ai.home currently point at the same FastAPI process
# (apps/api) since /v1/chat is served from the same gateway as /health.
# grafana.home points at the Pi itself, where monitoring runs.
# No reverse proxy in front of any of these yet, so URLs still need a
# port (e.g. http://api.home:8000/health, http://grafana.home:3000)
# until that's added.
192.168.1.131 api.home
192.168.1.131 ai.home
192.168.1.253 grafana.home
